- `Future<SessionSweepReport> plan()` — pure plan (no deletes).
- `Future<SessionSweepReport> apply()` — plan then apply with E2 re-checks.
- `Future<SessionSweepReport> sweep({required bool dryRun})` → dryRun ? plan() : apply().
- `Future<SessionSweepReport> bootEnforce()` — the boot policy: 
