Hmm — simpler: reuse the repo's `sessionNameQuick`? The sweper doesn't hold a repo. I'll implement `_nameFor(SessionDiskUsage)` with SessionChunkReader over segments (listSessionSegmentPaths from session_storage.dart).

Wait, actually, is lazy name resolution right for the PLAN too? Yes — plan applies the same selection algorithm. Deterministic given same fs + clock.

