}
``
`_deleteUnit`: primary + siblings via remove(force), `.tools/<sid>.yaml` remove, usage dir remove(recursive) (with symlink-kind guard), spill dir remove(recursive) (guard). Count actual freed: sum of stat sizes BEFORE removing (we have them from usage — reuse action.bytes + spill bytes measured at plan time; at apply, measure spill again? Plan measured spillBytes; apply: just remove, freed += planned values. If files vanished meanwhile, force removes succeed silently. Fine.)

Log line format (AC7):
`retention: deleted <primaryPath> (<human> total; age <ageDays>d; over-cap)` — plus skip lines `retention: skipped <primaryPath> (became live mid-sweep)`.

Blocker note lines:
`retention: still over cap by <human>; exempt blockers (largest first):`
` - <path> (<human>, <reason>)`

