By design: no cap + under soft-warn → silence. But the MANUAL verb with no cap should still help the user (they explicitly invoked clean). The renderer is shared with boot — boot wants silence (AC1), the verb wants a hint. So the COMMAND should add its own hint when `!retention.hasCap`:

```dart
